{"1691280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Maximum Football", "steam_appid": 1691280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3323790, 3171210, 3171200, 3171190], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2 Leagues. 1 Universe. Your Terms.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your legacy in Maximum Football, where you can play both college and pro football in one shared universe. Fully customize your team and build your dream roster to play solo or take it to the gridiron in local or online multiplayer. In Maximum Football, you have ultimate control over football simulation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOOTBALL ON YOUR TERMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just play the game, build it. Maximum Football’s deep customization suite gives you the power to create a unique identity. Craft the perfect helmet and jersey combination, use custom logos, and edit every detail of your roster to dominate the competition. Modify every piece of your football universe the way you want it, from league sizes to the rulesets. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A COLLEGE DYNASTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dynasty Mode, you'll take the reins as head coach, scouring the nation for top recruits, developing their talent, and making the strategic decisions that lead to championships. You also take on the responsibilities of your school’s Athletic Director, where you upgrade and manage your stadium and facilities, as well as every detail of your school. This is a deep, multi-season experience for any college football fanatic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN A PRO FRANCHISE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your hand at managing a pro team by building your roster from free agency and the draft, running the front office and stadium amenities, and making the game-time decisions to cement your franchise into a league leader. Connect Dynasty Mode with Franchise Mode to build one football universe, where you can draft your college superstars onto your pro roster. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AUTHENTIC FOOTBALL GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by the Unreal Engine 5, every snap is brought to life with our physics-based gameplay system. Feel the weight of every collision and experience the freedom of realistic player animations. This is football where your skill on the sticks truly matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play today for free!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2 Leagues. 1 Universe. Your Terms.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your legacy in Maximum Football, where you can play both college and pro football in one shared universe. Fully customize your team and build your dream roster to play solo or take it to the gridiron in local or online multiplayer. In Maximum Football, you have ultimate control over football simulation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOOTBALL ON YOUR TERMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just play the game, build it. Maximum Football’s deep customization suite gives you the power to create a unique identity. Craft the perfect helmet and jersey combination, use custom logos, and edit every detail of your roster to dominate the competition. Modify every piece of your football universe the way you want it, from league sizes to the rulesets. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A COLLEGE DYNASTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dynasty Mode, you'll take the reins as head coach, scouring the nation for top recruits, developing their talent, and making the strategic decisions that lead to championships. You also take on the responsibilities of your school’s Athletic Director, where you upgrade and manage your stadium and facilities, as well as every detail of your school. This is a deep, multi-season experience for any college football fanatic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN A PRO FRANCHISE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your hand at managing a pro team by building your roster from free agency and the draft, running the front office and stadium amenities, and making the game-time decisions to cement your franchise into a league leader. Connect Dynasty Mode with Franchise Mode to build one football universe, where you can draft your college superstars onto your pro roster. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AUTHENTIC FOOTBALL GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by the Unreal Engine 5, every snap is brought to life with our physics-based gameplay system. Feel the weight of every collision and experience the freedom of realistic player animations. This is football where your skill on the sticks truly matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play today for free!</p>", "short_description": "Forge your legacy in Maximum Football, where you can play both college and pro football in one shared universe. Recruit the next college superstar and take them into the pros to become a future Hall of Famer. Build your team with unparalleled in-game customization that gives you ultimate control.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691280/df94621b6cd50512a24c7d3d09e593c1b86c17e6/header.jpg?t=1778190294", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691280/2a8c9c7b12b5c6711df37b8b49ee5a540fa8322c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778190294", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691280/2a8c9c7b12b5c6711df37b8b49ee5a540fa8322c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778190294", "website": "https://www.maxfootballgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 12500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeF